WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.375
Bitta bosish.

00:00:01.475 --> 00:00:03.528
Savatga qo‘shish. Osonmi?

00:00:04.318 --> 00:00:09.398
Lekin shu bitta bosish ortida savol, xotira va ozgina hisob bor.

00:00:10.415 --> 00:00:11.442
Keling, ichini ochamiz.

00:00:12.199 --> 00:00:15.956
Avval do‘konning o‘zi. Mahsulotlar API’dan uchib keladi.

00:00:16.006 --> 00:00:19.472
Filtrlang. Saralang. Katak yoki ro‘yxat.

00:00:20.081 --> 00:00:24.020
Endi birini tanlaymiz. Bar stullari. To‘q sariq. Faqat bitta.

00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:24.934
Va… bosdik.

00:00:26.034 --> 00:00:26.978
To‘xtang.

00:00:27.228 --> 00:00:31.806
Birinchi savol. U savatda bormi? Mahsulot o‘shami? Rangi o‘shami?

00:00:31.756 --> 00:00:36.273
Ha? Unda faqat soni oshadi. Yo‘q? O‘ziga yangi qator oladi.

00:00:38.131 --> 00:00:41.026
Savatning o‘zi-chi? U qandaydir serverda emas.

00:00:40.976 --> 00:00:43.690
U mana shu yerda, brauzerning o‘z xotirasida.

00:00:44.487 --> 00:00:50.781
Mana bu kichik belgi va undan keyingi hammasi? Soni. Jami. Barchasi o‘sha xotiradan hisoblanadi.

00:00:51.352 --> 00:00:55.163
Bu yerda haqiqiy to‘lov yo‘q. Lekin mantiq-chi? U haqiqiy.
